### ======================================
### AI Module Test
### Author: OpenCode
### Version: v1.1
### ======================================

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### ============================
### Happy Path - 生成报告
### ============================

### 经营概览（约 5-10 秒）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "OVERVIEW",
  "range": "MONTH"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("reportId", response.body.data.id);
%}


### 销售分析
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "SALES",
  "range": "MONTH"
}


### 库存分析
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "INVENTORY",
  "range": "MONTH"
}


### ============================
### 查询报告
### ============================

### 历史列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 单条详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================
### 边界测试 → 400
### ============================

### 空参数
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}


### 非法 type
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "INVALID_TYPE",
  "range": "MONTH"
}


### 超长时间范围
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "OVERVIEW",
  "range": "2010-01-01_TO_2026-12-31"
}


### 报告不存在 → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
